-type="table-fn" rid="tfn9-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Day</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;rMSSD</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.58 (&#x02212;4.18 to 3.01)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;SDNN</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;9.39 (&#x02212;22.34 to 3.57)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;SDNN<sub>i</sub></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;4.06 (&#x02212;9.22 to 1.10)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Night</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;rMSSD</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;8.32 (&#x02212;16.29 to &#x02212;0.35)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn10-ehp0115-001046">**</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;SDNN</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;14.77 (&#x02212;31.52 to 1.97)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn9-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;SDNN<sub>i</sub></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;8.37 (&#x02212;17.93 to 1.20)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn9-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn8-ehp0115-001046"><label>a</label><p>Adjusted for nonwork HRV measure over the same time period, age, and smoking status.</p></fn><fn id="tfn9-ehp0115-001046"><label>*</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.10.</p></fn><fn id="tfn10-ehp0115-001046"><label>**</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t4-ehp0115-001046" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>PM2.5 regression coefficients [95% confidence interval (CI)] for models of nighttime rMSSD, SDNN, or SDNN<sub>i</sub> after restricting the data set.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">HRV measure (msec)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Model I<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn11-ehp0115-001046">a</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn12-ehp0115-001046">b</xref> None</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Model II<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn11-ehp0115-001046">a</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn13-ehp0115-001046">c</xref> No cardiac compromise</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Model III<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn11-ehp0115-001046">a</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn14-ehp0115-001046">d</xref> No hypertension</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Night rMSSD (msec)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;8.32 (&#x02212;16.29 to &#x02212;0.35)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn16-ehp0115-001046">**</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;8.19 (&#x02212;17.31 to 0.93)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn15-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;6.71 (&#x02212;16.17 to 2.75)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Night SDNN (msec)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;14.77 (&#x02212;31.52 to 1.97)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn15-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;13.97 (&#x02212;32.55 to 4.61)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;18.73 (&#x02212;39.68 to 2.22)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn15-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Night SDNN<italic><sub>i</sub></italic> (msec)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;8.37 (&#x02212;17.93 to 1.20)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn15-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;8.78 (&#x02212;19.76 to 2.21)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;9.29 (&#x02212;20.84 to 2.26)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn15-ehp0115-001046">*</xref></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn11-ehp0115-001046"><label>a</label><p>Adjusted for nonwork nighttime HRV, age, and smoking status.</p></fn><fn id="tfn12-ehp0115-001046"><label>b</label><p>Includes 36 individuals over 49 measurement occasions.</p></fn><fn id="tfn13-ehp0115-001046"><label>c</label><p>Includes 33 individuals over 44 measurement occasions, including 2 individuals who reported no cardiac compromise on initial participation, and excluding subsequent participation reporting cardiac compromise.</p></fn><fn id="tfn14-ehp0115-001046"><label>d</label><p>Includes 32 individuals over 41 measurement occasions, including 2 individuals who reported no hypertension on initial participation, and excluding subsequent participation reporting hypertension.</p></fn><fn id="tfn15-ehp0115-001046"><label>*</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.10.</p></fn><fn id="tfn16-ehp0115-001046"><label>**</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>